      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A quieter way",
      "size_px": 95,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        400,
        693,
        121
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "through the city",
      "size_px": 95,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        520,
        795,
        121
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "There is more to a familiar street than the quickest route from one place to",
      "size_px": 34,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        670,
        1320,
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "another.",
      "size_px": 34,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        724,
        163,
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At seven in the morning, the city belongs to people who have somewhere to be and people who are happy",
      "size_px": 26,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        803,
        1433,
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "to take their time. A baker lifts the shutters, a cyclist waits beside the crossing, and the first bus turns into",
      "size_px": 26,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        843,
        1428,
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the square. Yesterday's rain has left a little water between the paving stones. In every window, the light is",
      "size_px": 26,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        883,
        1425,
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "different.",
      "size_px": 26,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        923,
        138,
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We usually follow the same route without looking closely. Today, take the longer way. Walk past the small",
      "size_px": 26,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        988,
        1424,
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "park, turn left at the library, and stop where the road meets the river. You might notice a painted door, a",
      "size_px": 26,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        1028,
        1398,
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "row of uneven rooftops, or a tree growing through a gap in the wall. None of these things is new, but",
      "size_px": 26,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        1068,
        1350,
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "attention gives them another life.",
      "size_px": 26,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        1108,
        458,
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Good places leave room for this kind of discovery. They offer clear paths without deciding every step, and",
      "size_px": 26,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        1173,
        1435,
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "enough space for different rhythms to meet. By the time the shops are open, the quiet has become a",
      "size_px": 26,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        1213,
        1360,
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "conversation. Someone is carrying flowers. Someone is finding the way home. The street holds all of them,",
      "size_px": 26,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        1253,
        1438,
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and the day has only just begun.",
      "size_px": 26,
      "ss01": false,
      "kern": true,
      "rect": [
        72,
        1293,
        450,
        45
      ]
    },
